== risk: 1 runs, left out map[]
# The risk
  pairs Risk | Owner | Category | Exposure status | Mean annualized loss | 10th percentile | 90th percentile | Treatment decision
# Scenario: Claims leak
  pairs Pinned run | Control set | Scenario version | Iterations | Engine version | Seed | Input digest | Results digest
## Results
  table s1-summary [subject:text mean:amount p10:amount p50:amount p90:amount p99:amount] 2 rows
  chart exceedance x=loss series=[p] log=true, data s1-curve 3 rows
  chart histogram x=from series=[share] log=false, data s1-histogram 60 rows
## Breakdown and drivers
  table s1-breakdown [part:text name:text mean:amount share:percent] 4 rows
  table s1-drivers [input:text low:amount high:amount swing:amount spearman:number] 1 rows
## Provenance
  table s1-estimates [input:text range:text confidence:percent sources:text elicitation:text] 8 rows
  table s1-requests [title:text version:number status:text due:date created:date] 0 rows
# Treatment
  pairs Decision | Plan version
  paragraph
  table actions [due:date action:text owner:text state:text overdue:text] 0 rows
# Acceptance history
  table acceptance-history [at:time step:text by:text tier:number expires:date reason:text] 3 rows
== portfolio: 2 runs, left out map[unquantified:0]
# Exposure
  pairs Roll-up | Computed | Stale | Risks included | Risks left out | Business units excluded
  table rollup [subject:text mean:amount p10:amount p50:amount p90:amount p99:amount] 1 rows
  chart histogram x=from series=[share] log=false, data rollup-histogram 60 rows
# Largest risks
  table largest [risk:text owner:text mean:amount p10:amount p90:amount status:text] 2 rows
# By business unit
  table by-unit [unit:text risks:number quantified:number sum:amount p90:amount] 0 rows
# Coverage
  pairs Open risks | With a current analysis | Stale | Computing | Unquantified
# Acceptances
  pairs Active | Expiring within 30 days | Expired | Suspended | Awaiting decision
# Treatment
  pairs Open actions | Overdue actions
# Trend
  paragraph
  table trend [taken:time open:number current:number stale:number unquantified:number sum:amount rollup_mean:amount rollup_p90:amount accepted:number overdue:number] 0 rows
